  "title": "Centre pushes states to accelerate PNG adoption, seeks district-level officers",
  "summary": "The Centre pushes states to speed up the adoption of natural gas (PNG) for cooking, following the disruption in India's LPG supply chain during the West Asia crisis. This initiative seeks to address energy transition challenges and improve logistics.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Centre has requested states to appoint district-level officers to coordinate with gas distributors and oil marketing companies.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "PNG is seen as a safer, cleaner, and more efficient cooking fuel, contributing to India's energy transition objectives.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The goal is to reduce logistics burdens and improve consumer convenience in the transition to natural gas.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
